ity_assets/images/apps/2909400/df23c95f5b524acc86d7c9603d111b5faeab7b9d.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1758978906,"flAchieved":0},{"strID":"ACH_49","strName":"5-Star Hotel","strDescription":"Donate 60 items to the treasure trove at Johnny's Seaside Inn.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2909400/308cf3530aa78082faa1cc2a905bea8e91367381.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1758978906,"flAchieved":0},{"strID":"ACH_50","strName":"7-Star Hotel","strDescription":"Inform Johnny that you have donated all possible items to his treasure trove.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2909400/33e33c72f4de6307d6cfbb15a90753c6cc9344ec.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1758978906,"flAchieved":0},{"strID":"ACH_51","strName":"Polygonal Prizefighter","strDescription":"Defeat Sephiroth in 3D Brawler.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2909400/b8940baff577471fe331fd5566c69404d2471450.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1758978906,"flAchieved":0},{"strID":"ACH_53","strName":"Are You Not Entertained?","strDescription":"Complete all bouts in the Musclehead Colosseum.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2909400/cc3a31b42638fdf0f75cf85e6af10f7da78af30e.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1758978906,"flAchieved":0},{"strID":"ACH_54","strName":"Hall of Famer","strDescription":"Win all chocobo races.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2909400/ba06ad5cfb77f55ef234e8f9c60afb950260c3a2.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1758978906,"flAchieved":0},{"strID":"ACH_55","strName":"My Job Here Is Done","strDescription":"Complete all quests.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/2909400/73fa4ba47cc2fe7c66646caab8208122bc8a209b.jpg","bAchieved":true,"rtUnlocked":1758978906,"flAchieved":0}],"nTotal":61,"nAchieved":61}}],["achievementmap",{"version":5,"data":"[]"}],["usernews",{"version":5,"data":["COoHEL3aqMgGGVDjswIAAHABIaaQn2ABABABKdhkLAAAAAAAUdMH8OEaciIHYL3aqMgGcL3aqMgG"]}],["gameactivity",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Square Enix","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/developer/squareenix"}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"Square Enix","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/squareenix"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"FINAL FANTASY","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/34459938"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"The second game of the FINAL FANTASY VII remake trilogy.\r\n\r\nExperience the award-winning RPG with support for up to 4K resolution and 120 FPS, enhanced lighting and textures, variable refresh rate (VRR), NVIDIA DLSS, and more. The game also supports play using the DualSense® controller.\r\n\r\nAfter escaping Midgar, the City of Mako, Cloud and his comrades shatter the barriers of fate and embark on a new journey into the wide world beyond.\r\n\r\nA brand-new adventure awaits as a vast, multifaceted world unfolds before you. Gallop across grassy plains on the back of a chocobo as you explore the world before you.\r\n\r\n[h2]■ Story[/h2]\r\nThe lifestream represents the very cycle of life and death, where all life emerges from the planet and returns to its embrace. However, the Shinra Electric Power Company ruthlessly drains the planet of its very essence, the lifestream, and processes it for industry as &quot;mako.&quot;\r\n\r\nAfter overcoming countless fierce battles in the mako-powered metropolis of Midgar, ex-SOLDIER Cloud Strife and his companions step out into the wider world. Riding across grassy plains atop chocobos, they embark on an uncertain path, beginning their fated journey across the planet.\r\n\r\nAt the same time, SOLDIER First Class Zack Fair walks through the wastelands outside of Midgar. Wounded and weary, he drags his battered body forward while supporting his dear friend Cloud, who is delirious from mako poisoning. Beyond the veil of death, an ominous rift tears the heavens above.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, the Wutai interim government leads the Shinra Resistance Committee in a declaration of war.\r\n\r\nIn a grim procession, mysterious black-robed figures carry the remains of Jenova, the alien entity infamously known as the cataclysm from the stars and the catalyst of our plight.\r\n\r\nSensing the threat to the Planet itself, the fearsome guardians known as Weapons, awaken and rise from the lifestream.\r\n\r\nThrough the machinations of Cloud’s sworn enemy Sephiroth, the strands of destiny intertwine and are reborn again.\r\n\r\n[img big_src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909400/extras_big/a2fc7c3f3ca183edc3d1b554179cd333.avif?t=1762274642\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909400/extras/a2fc7c3f3ca183edc3d1b554179cd333.avif?t=1762274642[/img]\r\n\r\n[h2]The FINAL FANTASY VII remake trilogy[/h2]\r\nThe FINAL FANTASY VII remake project uses the latest technology to bring FINAL FANTASY VII - the legendary RPG that enchanted the world - to a new generation. Fans can now experience the beloved story reimagined.\r\n\r\nThe first game in the trilogy, FINAL FANTASY VII REMAKE, was released in 2020, achieving critical acclaim across the globe and shipping over seven million units worldwide. Now, the second game, FINAL FANTASY VII REBIRTH, continues the story at the heart of the trilogy.\r\n\r\n[img width=\"616\" height=\"347\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909400/extras/b83c950025da0f18394725d954f8be32.avif?t=1762274642[/img]","strSnippet":"The Unknown Journey Continues... After escaping the city of Midgar, Cloud and his friends set out on a journey across the planet. New adventures await in a vibrant, expansive world in this standalone entry of the FFVII remake trilogy."}}]]